# Image assets: mark them explicitly so git never treats one as text and
# rewrites its line endings. Git warns "CRLF will be replaced by LF" when a
# binary file does not happen to look binary to its content sniffing, which is
# what images hit. Note *.svg is deliberately absent — it is XML text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
